Jeffrey (Nov 20, 10:13 PM CT): "Remove pro5000 from gpu pool." Today the only way to keep the factory off a GPU is to unset its secrets. The factory should support excluding a GPU from the pool without touching its secrets or its model server.

## Acceptance criteria
- `factory/pi/gpu.py` has `excluded(env=None)`: the union of `FACTORY_GPU_EXCLUDE` (comma/space separated) and the file `~/.config/factory/gpu-exclude` (path override `FACTORY_GPU_EXCLUDE_FILE`; one GPU per line or comma separated;
